msgid "Building VTK with Dawn (Highly Experimental)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:15
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:17
msgid "Git"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:18
msgid "tools for building VTK"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:20
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:21
msgid ""
"On desktop (Linux, macOS, and Windows), this module uses Dawn's C++ WebGPU "
"implementation. You can get Dawn with any of these two methods:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:23
msgid "Build Dawn from source."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:24
msgid "Fetch pre-built Dawn binaries built in release mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:26
msgid ""
"These two methods are supported on all three operating systems. Pre-build "
"Dawn binaries are available only for linux-x86_64, windows-x86_64, macos-"
"x86_64 and macos-arm64. If you are on a different platform, you will need to "
"build Dawn from source."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:29
msgid ""
"Here, `VTK_SOURCE_DIR` is the path to the root of the VTK source directory, "
"and `VTK_BUILD_DIR` is the path to the directory where you want to build VTK."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:31
msgid "Build Dawn from source"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:33
msgid ""
"Dawn should be built at tag [v20260421.125655](https://github.com/google/"
"dawn/tree/v20260421.125655). Here, `DAWN_INSTALL_DIR` should point to the "
"directory where Dawn is installed (should contain `lib` and `include` "
"directories)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:36
msgid ""
"# Clone the repo and checkout the required version\n"
"git clone https://github.com/google/dawn dawn && cd dawn\n"
"git checkout v20260421.125655\n"
"cmake -S . -B out/Debug -GNinja -DDAWN_FETCH_DEPENDENCIES=ON -"
"DDAWN_ENABLE_INSTALL=ON\n"
"cmake --build out/Debug\n"
"cmake --install out/Debug --prefix ${DAWN_INSTALL_DIR}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:45
msgid "Fetch pre-built Dawn binaries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:47
msgid ""
"Run the following command to fetch pre-built Dawn binaries. This will "
"download and install Dawn to `VTK_SOURCE_DIR/.gitlab`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:0
msgid "Linux"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:52
msgid ""
"cd \"${VTK_SOURCE_DIR}\"\n"
"CMAKE_CONFIGURATION=\"fedora\" cmake -P .gitlab/ci/download_dawn.cmake\n"
"export DAWN_INSTALL_DIR=\"${VTK_SOURCE_DIR}/.gitlab/dawn\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:0
msgid "macOS-arm64"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:60
msgid ""
"cd \"${VTK_SOURCE_DIR}\"\n"
"CMAKE_CONFIGURATION=\"macos_arm64\" cmake -P .gitlab/ci/download_dawn.cmake\n"
"export DAWN_INSTALL_DIR=\"${VTK_SOURCE_DIR}/.gitlab/dawn\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:0
msgid "macOS-x86_64"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:68
msgid ""
"cd \"${VTK_SOURCE_DIR}\"\n"
"CMAKE_CONFIGURATION=\"macos_x86_64\" cmake -P .gitlab/ci/download_dawn."
"cmake\n"
"export DAWN_INSTALL_DIR=\"${VTK_SOURCE_DIR}/.gitlab/dawn\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:0
msgid "Windows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:76
msgid ""
"cd \"$env:VTK_SOURCE_DIR\"\n"
"$env:CMAKE_CONFIGURATION=\"windows\"; cmake -P .gitlab/ci/download_dawn."
"cmake\n"
"$env:DAWN_INSTALL_DIR=\"$env:VTK_SOURCE_DIR\\.gitlab\\dawn\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:84
msgid ""
"After you are finished, you should see a new directory `VTK_SOURCE_DIR/."
"gitlab/dawn` which contains the pre-built Dawn binaries. Set "
"`DAWN_INSTALL_DIR` to `VTK_SOURCE_DIR/.gitlab/dawn` so that you can pass it "
"to CMake when configuring VTK's build."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:86
#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:132
msgid "Configure and build VTK"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:88
msgid ""
"Run the following commands to configure and build VTK with WebGPU support."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:0
msgid "Linux/macOS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:93
msgid ""
"cmake \\\n"
"-S \"${VTK_SOURCE_DIR}\" \\\n"
"-B \"${VTK_BUILD_DIR}\" \\\n"
"-GNinja \\\n"
"-DVTK_ENABLE_WEBGPU=ON \\\n"
"-DDawn_DIR=\"${DAWN_INSTALL_DIR}/lib/cmake/Dawn\" \\\n"
"-DVTK_BUILD_TESTING=ON\n"
"\n"
"cmake --build \"${VTK_BUILD_DIR}\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:107
msgid ""
"cmake `\n"
"-S \"$env:VTK_SOURCE_DIR\" `\n"
"-B \"$env:VTK_BUILD_DIR\" `\n"
"-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release `\n"
"-GNinja `\n"
"-DVTK_ENABLE_WEBGPU=ON `\n"
"-DDawn_DIR=\"$env:DAWN_INSTALL_DIR/lib/cmake/Dawn\" `\n"
"-DVTK_BUILD_TESTING=ON\n"
"\n"
"cmake --build \"$env:VTK_BUILD_DIR\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:122
msgid ""
"When copy pasting the commands on Windows, please paste them into a "
"Powershell window and not a Command prompt!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:126
msgid ""
"On Windows, ensure that you are using the same `CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE` for both "
"building Dawn and configuring VTK. Or else, you will see a linker error "
"`LNK2038: mismatch detected for '_ITERATOR_DEBUG_LEVEL': value '0' doesn't "
"match value '2' in vtkRenderingWebGPUObjectFactory.cxx.obj`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:129
msgid "WebAssembly"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:130
msgid ""
"On WebAssembly, this module uses the WebGPU implementation provided by the "
"browser. You do not need to build Dawn from source or fetch pre-built Dawn "
"binaries. You just need to configure and build VTK with Emscripten. It takes "
"care of linking the WebGPU implementation provided by the browser (with the "
"`--use-port=emdawnwebgpu` flag)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:134
msgid ""
"Run the following commands to configure and build VTK for WASM with WebGPU "
"support."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:136
msgid ""
"emcmake cmake \\\n"
"-S \"${VTK_SOURCE_DIR}\" \\\n"
"-B \"${VTK_BUILD_DIR}\" \\\n"
"-GNinja \\\n"
"-DVTK_ENABLE_WEBGPU=ON \\\n"
"-DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=OFF \\\n"
"-DVTK_BUILD_TESTING=ON\n"
"\n"
"cmake --build \"${VTK_BUILD_DIR}\"\n"
msgstr ""

